Server init.
>> a := Blob nei: 4.
a bytes: ( Lëscht nei ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob nei: 4.
b bytes: ( Lëscht nei ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
>> c := a nei.
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will return 0
{ Ausgab schreiwen: ( a ^ c ), nei-zeil. } offänken: { :e Ausgab schreiwen: e, nei-zeil. }, starten.
a fräiginn.
b fräiginn.
